Z||000023||mrfiero||11-29-2001||08:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B> VERY Nice... Thank You... </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>No problem.  I'll take some interior shots as soon as I can.  I wish I could bottle the "new car" smell for you too.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>If at all possible, buy a low mileage trailer queen.  I'm not saying don't drive it, just buy it from someone who hasn't driven it!  It is well worth the extra $$$, especially when you are dealing with the beechwood interior and gold wheels.  <P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>I really want a Black GT now..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I don't blame you!  I'll keep my eyes open for a nice one......but if it's too nice I might buy it for myself!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>What options are you looking at getting or does it matter?  I guess I mainly need to know what tranny you prefer.  LMK.<P>||||reg||1
